[orch:err] ## Scoring guide
[orch:err] - **90–100:** merge-ready; tests match risk; no open defects
[orch:err] - **70–89:** solid; minor gaps or nits only
[orch:err] - **40–69:** meaningful issues or missing tests on risky paths
[orch:err] - **0–39:** blocking correctness/security problems
[orch:err] 
[orch:err] ## Severity calibration (H20 / tests)
[orch:err] - **Missing tests for new production behavior the PR claims to fix → REQUEST CHANGES.**
[orch:err]   Put the gap under **Blocking**, not only Suggestions. Score ≤69.
[orch:err] - Multi-behavior PRs: tests must cover **each** production path changed (not just one of them).
[orch:err] - Never **APPROVE** while also asking the author to add tests for code this PR introduced.
[orch:err] - Docstring/style-only gaps stay Suggestions/Nits.
