[orch:err] ### pytorch/pytorch#186918 — [Test] Add test hardware classification for test classes
[orch:err] - State: `CLOSED` · Closing-link from PR: no · Source: `hash`
[orch:err] - URL: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/186918
[orch:err] - Author: orangeH25
