### Summary
This PR systematically annotates 316 test case subclasses across 59 CPython test
files with the hardware classification flag `HardwareClassification.GENERIC` to 
support hardware classification filtering introduced previously. This is a 
large-scale metadata addition that does not change test logic or behaviors and 
therefore poses very low risk. The patch imports the necessary classification 
enum and sets the classification attribute, enabling device-agnostic filtering.

